  "description": {
    "en": "Yonex PolyTour Pro is the flagship all-around co-polyester in the PolyTour family. It combines soft feel, excellent comfort, easy power and reliable spin, making it suitable for players of every swing speed. Compared with firmer PolyTour models, PolyTour Pro provides greater ball pocketing and a more forgiving response.",

    "zh": "Yonex PolyTour Pro 是 Yonex PolyTour 系列最经典、最均衡的聚酯球线。官方定位为适合所有挥拍速度球员的 Soft All-Around Poly，兼顾力量、旋转、舒适性与控制。相比 PolyTour Strike、Fire、Tough 等偏硬型号，PolyTour Pro 提供更明显的 Ball Pocketing、更柔和的击球反馈以及更高的容错率，因此成为 Yonex 最受欢迎的聚酯球线之一。"
  },

